{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/20227","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:25.704406+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"I suspect the issue is that `o_ref` is uninitialized, so any locations in the buffer that you don't write will be filled with whatever bits happened to be in the buffer at the time it was allocated. If you want particular values in those locations, you'll need to assign those values.\r\n\r\n@sharadmv may be able to confirm whether my guess is right.","created_at":"2024-03-13T14:03:49Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/20227#issuecomment-1994483414","id":1994483414,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/20227","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc524WbW","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1994483414/reactions"},"updated_at":"2024-03-13T14:04:10Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1994483414","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"NONE","body":"I think this is correct, I just did this assignment of values to the output and it worked but still interesting to see this happening.","created_at":"2024-03-13T14:06:16Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/20227#issuecomment-1994488528","id":1994488528,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/20227","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc524XrQ","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1994488528/reactions"},"updated_at":"2024-03-13T14:06:16Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1994488528","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81991553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsaoptima/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsaoptima/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsaoptima/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsaoptima/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bsaoptima","id":81991553,"login":"bsaoptima","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxOTkxNTUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsaoptima/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsaoptima/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsaoptima/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsaoptima/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsaoptima/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsaoptima","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\nHi there,\r\n\r\nSo I'm noticing a strange behavior in my code and I can't find anything to explain it.\r\n\r\n```\r\ndef mul_kernel(x_ref, y_ref, start, end, o_ref):\r\n    x = x_ref[start:end]\r\n    y = y_ref[start:end]\r\n    o_ref[start:end] = x * y\r\n\r\n@partial(jax.jit, static_argnums=(2,3))\r\ndef mul_vectors(x: jax.Array, y: jax.Array, start: int, end: int) -> jax.Array:\r\n    return pl.pallas_call(\r\n        lambda x, y, o_ref : mul_kernel(x, y, start, end, o_ref),\r\n        out_shape=jax.ShapeDtypeStruct(x.shape, x.dtype)\r\n    )(x, y)\r\nmul_vectors(jnp.arange(4), jnp.array([1,2,3,4]), 1, 3)\r\n```\r\nThis will output: `Array([1, 2, 6, 4], dtype=int32)`, which does not seem right because I expected the output to be `[0, 2, 6, 0]` which is exactly what I get if instead I do:\r\n\r\n`mul_vectors(jnp.array([1,2,3,4]), jnp.arange(4), 1, 3)`\r\n`Array([0, 2, 6, 0], dtype=int32)`\r\n\r\nThis does not seem logical, unless GPU handle value allocation differently than what I am used to. \r\n\r\nIs there any explanation for this?\r\n\r\nMany thanks!\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\npython=3.11.8\r\njax=0.4.25\r\njaxlib=0.4.25+cuda11.cudnn86\r\njaxtyping=0.2.25","closed_at":"2024-03-13T14:06:18Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81991553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsaoptima/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsaoptima/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsaoptima/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsaoptima/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bsaoptima","id":81991553,"login":"bsaoptima","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxOTkxNTUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsaoptima/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsaoptima/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsaoptima/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsaoptima/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsaoptima/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bsaoptima","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":2,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos